    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "It has been a pleasure to number you among\nour passengers today. We, the staff of the\nCalifornia Central Airline, hope your flight has\nbeen an enjoyable and comfortable one, as it is our\ndesire to serve you now and throughout the coming\nyears. We hope to see you often so we may pass along\nthe benefits and advantages of our new low fare\ncommute service.\nC. C. SHERMAN\nPRESIDENT\nCompare... You'll Go By Air!\nBUS\n•\nTRAIN\nPULLMAN\n• 5.15 Plus Meals. 12½ hrs.\n• 7.50 Plus Meals. 9½ hrs.\n• 20.67 Plus Meals. 9½ hrs.\nAIR COACH 9.99 Incl. snacks 1 hr. 57 min.\nALL RATES PLUS TAX\n201",
